# Currency Converter: "exile that card from your graveyard" - a card that is no longer in the graveyard when the trigger
# resolves is not the card any more (CR 400.7), so nothing is offered for it. Faithless Looting discards a Lightning Bolt
# and a Forest, two triggers go on the stack, and Bot2 answers with a Ghost Vacuum that exiles the Forest from the
# graveyard. Bot1's single Accept goes to the one prompt that is made, for the Bolt; if a prompt were made for the Forest
# as well it would take that Accept. The Bolt is then cashed in, which finds it exiled with the Converter (a Rogue,
# since it is a nonland card), while the Forest stays in exile as the Vacuum's.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Currency Converter
Faithless Looting
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Lightning Bolt
Forest
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Ghost Vacuum
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Currency Converter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Ghost Vacuum.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt; Forest)
Bot2.Battlefield.Ghost Vacuum.Activate(Bot1.Graveyard.Forest)
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Battlefield.Currency Converter.Activate(Ability: Treasure)

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Exile = Forest
Bot1.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt; Faithless Looting
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Ruby; Mox Jet; Currency Converter; Rogue Token
